graph TB
    subgraph "Client Browser"
        UI[User Interface<br/>React App]
        IF[Iframe<br/>Embedded App]
    end

    subgraph "Next.js Application"
        API[API Routes<br/>Token Management]
        ENC[Token Encryption<br/>AES-256-GCM]
    end

    subgraph "Go Proxy Server"
        PROXY[Reverse Proxy<br/>HTTP & WebSocket]
        DEC[Token Decryption<br/>AES-256-GCM]
    end

    subgraph "Databricks Platform"
        APP[Lakehouse Apps<br/>VSCode Editor]
        AUTH[OAuth Validation<br/>Bearer Token]
    end

    UI -->|Request Token| API
    API -->|Encrypt Token| ENC
    ENC -->|Encrypted URL| UI
    UI -->|Load Iframe| IF
    IF -->|Proxied Request| PROXY
    PROXY -->|Decrypt Token| DEC
    DEC -->|Add Auth Header| AUTH
    AUTH -->|Validate & Serve| APP
    APP -->|Response| PROXY
    PROXY -->|Forward| IF

    style UI fill:#e3f2fd
    style API fill:#fff3e0
    style PROXY fill:#f3e5f5
    style APP fill:#e8f5e9
